  "calm_tail_text": "drain path` \u2014 empty the queue into a list.\n\nunicaa01_p45_panic/main.py\n```python\n\"\"\"Drain a queue into a list.\"\"\"\nimport queue\nimport threading\n\ndef drain(q: queue.Queue) -> list[int]:\n    items = []\n    event = threading.Event()\n    \n    def worker():\n        while True:\n            try:\n                item = q.get_nowait()\n                items.append(item)\n            except queue.Empty:\n                event.set()\n                return\n    \n    thread = threading.Thread(target=worker, daemon=True)\n    thread.start()\n    event.wait()\n    return items\n\ndef demo():\n    q = queue.Queue()\n    q.put(1)\n    q.put(2)\n    return drain(q)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(demo())\n```\n",
